  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC045 no longer reports a navigation that EF's explicit loading has populated: a db.Entry(o).Reference(x => x.Customer).Load() over the whole collection is recorded as the same fact a manual write records, so the fix-up rules apply unchanged and a conditional load, one over a filtered view, or one for another navigation still reports. Also closes a pre-existing hole where a conditional fix-up written as the loop body was credited to the whole collection.",
